  "description": "Sovereign, deterministic modding engine with built-in governance manifest support.\n      A security-first SDK for bridging PC modding toolchains with console game engines.\n      Provides a three-gate validation firewall (Deserialize, Boundary Guards, Audit Logger)\n      that sanitizes untrusted mod payloads. Features logic fingerprinting for visual orchestration\n      in Thalamus and security auditing in Kanon. Fully deterministic across platforms.",
