  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.6.0 — Interface Alpha: Project Manifest & Logic Fingerprinting\n\n      New Features:\n      • ProjectManifest — Security dashboard snapshot for Thalamus visual IDE\n      • LogicFingerprint — SHA256 hash of all surfaces, weight tables, and behavior graphs\n      • GovernanceCertificate — Property on ModBridge for Kanon governance integration\n      • Governance Status Tracking — [UNGOVERNED], [PENDING_AUDIT], [GOVERNED_BY_KANON] prefixes on all audit log entries\n      • GenerateLogicFingerprint() — Deterministic fingerprinting engine supporting surfaces, weight distributions, and behavior graph definitions\n      • GenerateManifest() — Factory method to produce ProjectManifest with current governance state\n\n      New Namespaces:\n      • BridgeMod.Bridge.Models — ProjectManifest and GovernanceStatus enum\n\n      Architecture:\n      • Governance state is now tracked by ModBridge and reflected in all audit log entries\n      • Logic fingerprint is deterministic across platforms (netstandard2.1 and net8.0 compatible)\n      • Thalamus can now consume manifests as a \"security dashboard\"\n\n      Quality:\n      • 114/114 tests passing (100 existing + 14 new governance/fingerprint tests)\n      • 0 compiler warnings in Release configuration\n      • Backward compatible: all 100 pre-existing tests pass unmodified\n      • Full support for console mod certification workflows\n\n      Design:\n      • Fingerprinting uses \\x1F (Unit Separator) for deterministic hashing\n      • Weight table fingerprinting uses raw \"R\" format doubles for platform independence\n      • AuditLogger now tracks and reports governance status",
